        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "1f079eaf-e151-5cdd-b518-2e8ba88e8ff5",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: K. Shivaram Karanth\n- Topics: Yakshagana\n- Roles: writer, social activist, environmentalist, artist, film maker, thinker\n- Concepts: traditional theatre\n\nFacts:\n- K. Shivaram Karanth was born on 10 October 1902 and died on 9 December 1997.\n- K. Shivaram Karanth was a Kannada writer, social activist, environmentalist, Yakshagana artist, film maker, and thinker.\n- Yakshagana is a traditional theatre form.\n- Yakshagana is called \"ಯಕ್ಷಗಾನ\" in Kannada and \"ಆಟ\" in Tulu.\n- Yakshagana combines dance, music, dialogue, costume, make-up, and stage techniques in a unique style and form.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
